  4963ffcd4466d2be t("Grid of label (min 160, never wider than 40%) and value (minmax(0,1fr)). Values wrap: prose at word boundaries, codes and paths anywhere (overflow-wrap: anywhere). Below a 28rem container the pair stacks: label above, value full width. Container query on the grid, so a narrow detail pane at 1440 behaves like a phone.",Inter,12,r,align(l),lh(1.5)) p(32,326) s(1200,hug:36) f[(b34af7280dfbb2f8,#9A9A9F)] "Text 285"
